OL,3,ABritish Airways plane veers off
OL,4,AHeathrow taxiway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Airways plane became stuck in
OL,7,Fthe grass at Heathrow Airport after it
OL,8,Fveered off the taxiway.
OL,10,FThe Boeing 787 Dreamliner bound for
OL,11,FLagos in Nigeria became stuck after its
OL,12,Ffront wheel entered the grass as it was
OL,13,Ftaxiing independently from the gate to
OL,14,Fthe runway shortly after 10:00 GMT.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the west London
OL,17,Fairport said they were continuing to
OL,18,Fassist the plane back to the aircraft
OL,19,Fparking area, adding that there were no
OL,20,Finjuries and no impact on wider
OL,21,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
